    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but assigning meaning is just more work. it's a loop. you make meaning, then it goes away, then you make more. it's exhausted me. if i look at the math, the cost of staying (suffering) vs the cost of leaving (zero) ... it doesn't add up. staying just seems like a mathematical error. don't you see how much more efficient it is to just accept the void?",
